{"info": {"address1": "147, Mumbai-Pune Road", "address2": "Pimpri", "city": "Pune", "zip": "411018", "country": "India", "phone": "91 20 6719 0600", "fax": "91 20 6719 0792", "website": "https://www.elantas.com/beck-india", "industry": "Specialty Chemicals", "industryKey": "specialty-chemicals", "industryDisp": "Specialty Chemicals", "sector": "Basic Materials", "sectorKey": "basic-materials", "sectorDisp": "Basic Materials", "longBusinessSummary": "ELANTAS Beck India Limited manufactures and sells specialty chemicals for the electrical insulation and construction industries in India. The company operates through two segments, Electrical Insulations; and Engineering & Electronic Resins Solutions, and Materials. It provides wire enamels, such as primers, lubricants, and binder varnishes for fiberglass coated conductors; impregnating materials, including insulating varnishes and resins; and flexible electrical insulation materials. The company also offers casting and potting compounds comprising casting, potting, and encapsulation of electrical and electronic components, such as auto-electrical components, high-voltage insulators, instrument transformers, etc.; impregnation of high-voltage electrical machine windings; binder resins for glass-fibre filament wound arc chamber tubes; and diamond dotted paper for oil-filled transformers. In addition, it provides materials for electronic protection, including potting compounds, such as conformal, air drying resistant, rapid process acrylic, waterborne conformal, and silicone coatings; and thermal interface materials. Further, the company offers engineering materials, such as construction chemicals comprising a range of resinous construction chemicals for industrial floorings, protective coatings, structural repairs, waterproofing, adhesives, and sealants, as well as specialty epoxy and polyurethane anti-microbial floorings and wall coating systems; and reactive polyamides used in epoxy resins to produce top coats and primers, as well as thermosetting adhesives for a various substrates. The company was incorporated in 1956 and is headquartered in Pune, India. ELANTAS Beck India Limited is a subsidiary of ELANTAS GmbH.", "fullTimeEmployees": 204, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Anurag  Roy", "age": 51, "title": "MD, President & Additional Director", "yearBorn": 1974, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 39886606, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sanjay  Kulkarni", "age": 58, "title": "CFO and VP of Information Technology & Procurement", "yearBorn": 1967, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Saurabh Kishor Kothade", "title": "Head of Finance & Accounts", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Dr. Meenu  Vijay", "title": "Vice President of Market & Technology Development", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ashutosh Bhalchandra Kulkarni", "title": "Company Secretary, Compliance Officer & Head of Legal", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Bharti  Bhosale", "title": "Head of Human Resources", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. M. L. Prabhune", "age": 59, "title": "Head of Engineering & Maintenance - Pimpri", "yearBorn": 1966, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sunilkumar  Patel", "age": 41, "title": "Head Projects - Ankleshawar", "yearBorn": 1984, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Devendra  Jadhav", "age": 44, "title": "Head of Sales & Business Development, EL-2 & EC", "yearBorn": 1981, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Abhiroop  Upadhyay", "title": "Head of Sales, Wire Enamels & Construction Chemical